1
00:00:01,458 --> 00:00:04,583
What the hell
did you just say?

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,500
From this moment on,

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:08,125
the Sovereign Sanctum is cutting off

4
00:00:08,125 --> 00:00:09,208
all support.

5
00:00:10,166 --> 00:00:11,375
What?

6
00:00:11,708 --> 00:00:13,000
Still don’t get it?

7
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,250
Everything you have right now, I gave it to you.

8
00:00:16,250 --> 00:00:18,083
Including every bit of support

9
00:00:18,083 --> 00:00:19,583
the Sovereign Sanctum has shown you.

10
00:00:19,625 --> 00:00:21,750
Even now you’re still spouting bullshit

11
00:00:21,750 --> 00:00:23,125
right in front of Steward Jeyn.

12
00:00:23,125 --> 00:00:24,791
You really are begging to die.

13
00:00:26,208 --> 00:00:31,250
Do you have any idea
what happens when you anger us?

14
00:00:31,250 --> 00:00:33,583
I created the Sovereign Sanctum.

15
00:00:33,583 --> 00:00:35,291
You want to talk about consequences?

16
00:00:35,291 --> 00:00:37,583
Why don’t you tell
me what they are?

17
00:00:37,583 --> 00:00:38,791
Hahaha!

18
00:00:38,791 --> 00:00:42,416
You actually dare claim you founded the God Sculpting Temple?

19
00:00:42,416 --> 00:00:43,666
He’s insane.

20
00:00:43,708 --> 00:00:46,500
He dares impersonate the supreme Godfather!

21
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:49,416
Kneel right now and
cut out your own tongue.

22
00:00:50,250 --> 00:00:53,000
Or I’ll slaughter your entire family.

23
00:00:54,875 --> 00:00:56,708
Severin, kneel and apologize right now!

24
00:00:57,333 --> 00:01:00,000
That’s one of the most
terrifying legends on the continent!

25
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,583
Hah, keep spinning your lies.

26
00:01:02,583 --> 00:01:05,708
You finally bit off
more than you can chew.

27
00:01:05,708 --> 00:01:07,625
Livia, please, help us!

28
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:12,458
Mother, you don’t
need to beg him.

29
00:01:12,791 --> 00:01:14,083
I’m not lying.

30
00:01:14,083 --> 00:01:17,083
I am the Godfather
of the Sovereign Sanctum.

31
00:01:17,083 --> 00:01:18,708
Mother, don’t be afraid.

32
00:01:18,708 --> 00:01:20,083
Severin isn’t lying.

33
00:01:20,083 --> 00:01:21,708
He is the
one who stands at

34
00:01:21,708 --> 00:01:24,250
the pinnacle of this world, the Godfather.

35
00:01:27,041 --> 00:01:29,041
What a perfect match.

36
00:01:29,041 --> 00:01:31,541
Lying so much you’ve
started believing it yourself.

37
00:01:32,875 --> 00:01:36,208
Redmond, let’s sign
the contract right now.

38
00:01:36,791 --> 00:01:38,500
Oh great Godfather, 

39
00:01:38,500 --> 00:01:42,291
please stop me from signing with the Sovereign Sanctum.

40
00:01:42,708 --> 00:01:45,750
Otherwise the Scott family
is about to soar.

41
00:01:46,458 --> 00:01:48,083
As you wish.

42
00:01:50,750 --> 00:01:53,791
By my decree as Godfather, all support

43
00:01:53,791 --> 00:01:56,958
for the Scott
family is hereby terminated.

44
00:01:59,291 --> 00:02:00,500
Haha!

45
00:02:00,500 --> 00:02:02,583
All that theater and nothing happened.

46
00:02:03,333 --> 00:02:05,500
Steward Jeyn, ignore this fool.

47
00:02:05,500 --> 00:02:06,791
Let’s sign the contract.

48
00:02:07,625 --> 00:02:08,791
Good.

49
00:02:25,041 --> 00:02:26,500
What…?!
